html","https://blog.sucuri.net/2019/03/zero-day-stored-xss-in-social-warfare.html","https://twitter.com/warfareplugins/status/1108852747099652099","https://wordpress.org/plugins/social-warfare/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9238","https://www.cybersecurity-help.cz/vdb/SB2019032105","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46794/","https://www.pluginvulnerabilities.com/2019/03/21/full-disclosure-of-settings-change-persistent-cross-site-scripting-xss-vulnerability-in-social-warfare/","https://www.wordfence.com/blog/2019/03/unpatched-zero-day-vulnerability-in-social-warfare-plugin-exploited-in-the-wild/","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Jun/1","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-9978","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46794","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-9978.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2019/CVE-2019-9978.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-9978-4330.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-9978-4329.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2019/9xxx/CVE-2019-9978.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/db471f1997301dc3f7f49ac6ce647b40e74d4e04/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-9978.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/2ac59005f6e227f031caa7bd5f42ccb71cf13dd9/2019/CVE-2019-9978.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/db471f1997301dc3f7f49ac6ce647b40e74d4e04/data/2019/CVE-2019-9978-mpgn_CVE-2019-9978.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2019/CVE-2019-9978/cve-2019-9978.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/db471f1997301dc3f7f49ac6ce647b40e74d4e04/data/2019/CVE-2019-9978-KTN1990_CVE-2019-9978.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2019-9978.yaml","https://github.com/hash3liZer/CVE-2019-9978","https://github.com/mpgn/CVE-2019-9978","https://github.com/KTN1990/CVE-2019-9978","https://github.com/grimlockx/CVE-2019-9978","https://github.com/yup-Ivan/CVE-2019-9978"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1509","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7238","title":"Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager 3 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager 3 的 coreui_Component 组件存在访问控制缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 /service/extdirect 接口发送特制的 POST 请求，利用 OrientDB 自定义函数功能注入恶意 JEXL 表达式，从而在目标服务器上执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 3.15.0 之前的所有 Nexus Repository Manager OSS/Pro 版本，攻击无需任何认证或用户交互，利用复杂度低，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7238"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-03-21T17:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager 至 3.15.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可通过反向代理或 WAF 规则限制对 /service/extdirect 路径的访问，仅允许可信 IP 调用该接口，并禁用不必要的 extdirect 功能模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.sonatype.com/hc/en-us/articles/360017310793-CVE-2019-7238-Nexus-Repository-Manager-3-Missing-Access-Controls-and-Remote-Code-Execution-February-5th-2019","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7238","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7238.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7238.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2019/CVE-2019-7238.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/nexus/cve-2019-7238_cmd.py","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/nexus/CVE-2019-7238.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-7238/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-7238.py","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Nexus/CVE-2019-7238/README.md","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/nexus/poc_nexus-cve-2019-7238_2019.py","https://github.com/BaizeSec/bylibrary/blob/dee1fbaa831df860c6905f80de8700211ba63098/docs/漏洞库/01-CMS漏洞/Nexus/cve-2019-7238_命令执行.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7238.py","https://github.com/DLR-SC/repository-synergy/blob/115e48c37e659b144b2c3b89695483fd1d6dc788/data/readme_files/mpgn.CVE-2019-7238.md","https://github.com/mpgn/CVE-2019-7238","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2019-7238","https://github.com/verctor/nexus_rce_CVE-2019-7238","https://github.com/magicming200/CVE-2019-7238_Nexus_RCE_Tool","https://github.com/DannyRavi/nmap-scripts"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1509.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0099","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1003030","title":"CloudBees Jenkins Pipeline Groovy 插件沙箱绕过漏洞","description":"CloudBees Jenkins Pipeline:Groovy 插件 2.63 及更早版本中存在沙箱绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过控制 Jenkins 流水线脚本，绕过 Groovy 沙箱安全限制，在 Jenkins 主节点 JVM 上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用受影响插件版本的 Jenkins 服务器，攻击者需具备控制流水线脚本的权限（如通过 Jenkinsfile 或 Pipeline 脚本注入），利用后可获得 Jenkins 主节点的完全控制权，进而执行系统级命令、访问敏感凭证或横向移动至其他内部系统。CVSS 评分为 9.9，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1003030"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-03-08T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:09:34Z","remediation":"立即将 Jenkins Pipeline: Groovy Plugin（workflow-cps）从 2.63 及以下版本升级至 2.64，同时将 Script Security Plugin 从 1.53 及以下版本升级至 1.54，以修复沙箱绕过漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在 Jenkins 前端网关或反向代理层限制对 `/pipeline` 相关端点的访问来源，仅允许受信任的 CI IP 段访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159603/Jenkins-2.63-Sandbox-Bypass.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/107476","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0739","https://jenkins.io/security/advisory/2019-03-06/#SECURITY-1336%20%282%29","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1003030","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48904","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-1003030.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/72c8106b40c5c9da957866ca68cfbb934fe51811/2019/CVE-2019-1003030.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1c8487d39144bddd392ea8e64c19d3184e53aad1/cves/2019/1003xxx/CVE-2019-1003030.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/8f58f2aca6f1139bd32d3740409b3ec8a97c5059/2019/1003xxx/CVE-2019-1003030.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/a6bf3825333b487cb000fcb8f17aae733dfe4630/2019/CVE-2019-1003030.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1003030.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1003030.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b858c1de67d8192aba338799e4dc25fc6df3edc6/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-1003030.json","https://github.com/daffainfo/AllAboutBugBounty/blob/0a16c9d981a270ba20730ad36475ed7ce7ceb79e/Technologies/Jenkins.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b858c1de67d8192aba338799e4dc25fc6df3edc6/GHSA/data/2019/CVE-2019-1003030.json","https://github.com/overgrowncarrot1/CVE-2019-1003030","https://github.com/cyberbelly/PoC-CVE-2019-1003030","https://github.com/WHrez1ns/exploits"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0088","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1003029","title":"Jenkins Script Security Plugin 沙箱绕过远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Jenkins Script Security Plugin 存在沙箱绕过漏洞，该插件在 Groovy 脚本解析、编译和实例化阶段未正确应用沙箱保护机制，攻击者可构造恶意的 Groovy 脚本绕过脚本安全沙箱，在 Jenkins master JVM 上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Jenkins Script Security Plugin 1.53 及更早版本，同时波及依赖该插件的多个流行插件，包括 Pipeline: Groovy Plugin、Matrix Project Plugin、Email Extension Plugin、Groovy Plugin 和 Job DSL Plugin。攻击者仅需要具备 Overall/Read 权限（最低读取权限），无需管理员身份即可远程利用此漏洞，通过 Jenkins 的 HTTP 端点（如 descriptorByName CheckScript）提交恶意脚本完成攻击，导致完全失控的远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1003029"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-03-08T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:09:34Z","remediation":"将 Jenkins Script Security Plugin 升级到 1.54 或更高版本，同时将依赖脚本安全插件的 Pipeline: Groovy Plugin 升级至 2.64、Groovy Plugin 升级至 2.2、Matrix Project Plugin 升级至 1.14、Email Extension Plugin 升级至 2.65、Job DSL Plugin 升级至 1.72，以彻底修复沙箱绕过漏洞并消除关联插件中的同类风险。升级前先在测试环境中验证插件兼容性，升级后彻底重启 Jenkins 服务，并在 Jenkins 管理界面的\"插件\"页面确认所有相关插件均已更新至安全版本。临时缓解措施：限制 Overall/Read 权限用户的访问范围，确保只有受信任的用户能够访问 Jenkins 实例。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/166778/Jenkins-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/107476","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0739","https://jenkins.io/security/advisory/2019-03-06/#SECURITY-1336%20%281%29","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1003029","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-1003029.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63ef18b5a7ac062afb6feeca70a71f97ad261ce7/cves/2019/1003xxx/CVE-2019-1003029.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2a9e9008e1c6ed4fdef8d3b5d090d4e3f6172a0/2019/1003xxx/CVE-2019-1003029.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1003029.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1003029.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7487bcebc8697fd3489bf1c4da6dea35d58f628c/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-1003029.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7487bcebc8697fd3489bf1c4da6dea35d58f628c/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-1003029.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-1003029.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-1003029.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-1003029.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0088.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0024","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0192","title":"Apache Solr Config API JMX 服务远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Solr 的 Config API 存在不安全的反序列化漏洞，攻击者可通过 HTTP POST 请求将 JMX 服务地址指向恶意的 RMI 服务器，触发 Solr 在反序列化 RMI 响应时执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Apache Solr 5.0.0 至 5.5.5 及 6.0.0 至 6.6.5 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需认证，远程即可利用，可导致服务器完全失陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0192"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-07T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:07:55Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache Solr 至 5.5.6 或 6.6.6 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可通过启用 Solr 的认证与授权插件（RuleBasedAuthorizationPlugin）限制 Config API 的访问权限，仅允许受信管理员调用；或在反向代理/防火墙层面拦截对 /admin/configs 等 Config API 端点的外部访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mail-archives.us.apache.org/mod_mbox/www-announce/2