rprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/apache/solr/CVE-2019-0192.yaml","https://github.com/DLR-SC/repository-synergy/blob/115e48c37e659b144b2c3b89695483fd1d6dc788/data/readme_files/mpgn.CVE-2019-0192.md","https://github.com/apache/solr-site/blob/809adea95ae06047fc7336dc2450424a735ce313/content/solr/security/2019-03-06-cve-2019-0192.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0192.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0192.md","https://github.com/google/security-testbeds/blob/6ac14434c57e26c4dede4754a208fd1d0bc1acd3/apache/solr/CVE-2019-0192/README.md","https://github.com/Imanfeng/Apache-Solr-RCE","https://github.com/mpgn/CVE-2019-0192","https://github.com/Rapidsafeguard/Solr-RCE-CVE-2019-0192"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0008","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0676","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 存在内存对象处理不当的信息泄漏漏洞。攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网站触发该漏洞，成功利用后可检测目标系统磁盘上是否存在特定文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Windows 系统中的 Internet Explorer 11，攻击需要用户交互（如点击链接），CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 3 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0676"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-03-05T23:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:40Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2019 年 3 月安全更新（适用于 Internet Explorer 11 的累积更新 KB4489873），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取。对于 Windows 10 系统，安装累积更新 KB4489886。无法立即打补丁时，可将 Internet Explorer 安全区域设置为「高」并禁用活动脚本，同时限制用户以管理员权限运行 IE 浏览器以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106886","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0676","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0676","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0676.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7e48ebbcec9e3d29e1565bd7d31349c1f27c7348/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0676.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0676.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-0676.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-0676.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/6910653c12819926fe934de0d0abc6b8de10874a/CVEs/2019/CVE-2019-0676.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-0676.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/b71fadde1b7e978c5ddefd15cc4442bd1ed5b1e5/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-0676","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-0676.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-0676.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0007","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0604","title":"Microsoft SharePoint 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft SharePoint 存在远程代码执行漏洞，由于软件在处理应用程序包时未能正确检查源标记（source markup），导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 SharePoint 服务器发送特制的应用程序包触发 .NET 反序列化，从而在目标系统上以 SharePoint 应用程序池权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SharePoint 2010/2013/2016/2019 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，且已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），存在公开的武器化利用代码。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 3 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0604"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-05T23:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:31Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 3 月安全更新（对应 SharePoint Server 2010 SP2、SharePoint Foundation 2013 SP1、SharePoint Enterprise Server 2016、SharePoint Server 2019 各版本的补丁），通过 Microsoft Update 或 WSUS 部署。如无法立即打补丁，可在 SharePoint 前端启用输入验证并限制应用包上传权限，同时使用 WAF 规则拦截反序列化攻击载荷作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106914","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0604","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0604","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48053","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/code/cves/2019/CVE-2019-0604.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-0604.md","https://github.com/k8gege/K8tools/blob/5aca0cef8bba0f00a001eb1f4f71b380205c4b8d/cve-2019-0604-exp.py","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2019-0604_分析及武器化.md","https://github.com/Y4er/dotnet-deserialization/blob/c8dac42dfc267d32492e18fe13a3ba5ef717b58c/SharePoint-CVE-2019-0604.md","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/SharePoint/CVE-2019-0604/README.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-0594.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/91cd776dc52d69c44e28d74a7360b0df58c99c7e/2019/CVE-2019-0604.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0604.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/CVE-2019-0604 分析及武器化.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0604.md","https://github.com/linhlhq/CVE-2019-0604","https://github.com/k8gege/CVE-2019-0604","https://github.com/MayankPandey01/Sparty-2.0","https://github.com/boxhg/CVE-2019-0604","https://github.com/Gh0st0ne/weaponized-0604"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0007.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0007.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0019","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-6223","title":"Apple iOS和macOS Mojave FaceTime组件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 和 macOS Mojave 的 FaceTime 组件在处理群组 FaceTime 通话时存在逻辑缺陷，攻击者作为通话发起方可利用该漏洞强制接收方自动接听通话，导致接收方的音频和视频内容在未经用户确认的情况下被传输，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需用户交互即可远程触发，影响 iOS 12.1.4 之前版本及 macOS Mojave 10.14.3 补充更新之前版本。Apple 已通过改进状态管理修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-6223"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-03-05T16:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:38:50Z","remediation":"立即将 iPhone/iPad 升级至 iOS 12.1.4 及以上版本，将 Mac 升级至 macOS Mojave 10.14.3 Supplemental Update (build 18D109) 及以上版本。可通过「设置→通用→软件更新」或「系统偏好设置→软件更新」完成升级。如无法立即更新，可在 FaceTime 设置中关闭「群组 FaceTime」功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/HT209520","https://support.apple.com/HT209521","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-6223","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-6223.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2019/6xxx/CVE-2019-6223.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2019/6xxx/CVE-2019-6223.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-6223.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-6223.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-6223.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-6223.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2019/CVE-2019-62xx/CVE-2019-6223.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/13889512387aab8222dfb3d51d4f65251575a372/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-6223","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-6223.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1682","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1682.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-9082","title":"ThinkPHP 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"ThinkPHP 3.2.4 之前版本存在访问控制错误漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 `public//?s=index/\\think\\app/invokefunction` 路由绕过权限检查，直接调用 `call_user_func_array` 函数执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响使用 ThinkPHP 框架的 Open Source BMS v1.1.1 等应用，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-9082"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-02-24T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:43:02Z","remediation":"升级 ThinkPHP 至 3.2.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 /think/app/invokefunction 路由的访问控制缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在应用入口处拦截包含 think\\app/invokefunction 的请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157218/ThinkPHP-5.0.23-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://github.com/xiayulei/open_source_bms/issues/33","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46488/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-9082","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46488","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-9082.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-9082.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f2