nkins Script Security Plugin 升级至 1.50 或更高版本，同时将 Pipeline: Groovy Plugin 升级至 2.61.1 以上、Pipeline: Declarative Plugin 升级至 1.3.4.1 以上。如无法立即升级，可在 Jenkins 系统配置中禁用未受信任的 SCM 仓库中的 Jenkinsfile 执行，并严格限制 Overall/Read 权限的授予范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152132/Jenkins-ACL-Bypass-Metaprogramming-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.rapid7.com/db/modules/exploit/multi/http/jenkins_metaprogramming","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2019:0326","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2019:0327","https://jenkins.io/security/advisory/2019-01-08/#SECURITY-1266","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46453/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46572/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46453","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-1003000.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-1003000.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2019/CVE-2019-1003000.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/400ed050b78dffbc3594fd5bafe67494479fdfd3/2019/CVE-2019-1003000.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e80f5d408ffad16b39381a0b04b1a01a2a54c308/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-1003000.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/Jenkins 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2019-1003000.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/jenkins/CVE-2019-1003000.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/middleware/Jenkins-远程代码执行漏洞-CVE-2019-1003000.md","https://github.com/BaizeSec/bylibrary/blob/dee1fbaa831df860c6905f80de8700211ba63098/docs/漏洞库/01-CMS漏洞/jenkins/cve-2019-1003000-jenkins远程命令执行.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-1003001.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2018/CVE-2018-1999002.md","https://github.com/adamyordan/cve-2019-1003000-jenkins-rce-poc","https://github.com/wetw0rk/Exploit-Development","https://github.com/1NTheKut/CVE-2019-1003000_RCE-DETECTION","https://github.com/purple-WL/Jenkins_CVE-2019-1003000","https://github.com/im23pds/CVE-2019-1003000-and-CVE-2018-1999002-Pre-Auth-RCE-Jenkins"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0028.toml"}]